title: "Agent Taskbay: Open-Source Human-in-the-Loop Console for AI Agents and A2A Workflows"
abstract: "A self-hosted, MIT-licensed operations console providing durable task queues, human approval gates, multi-modal artifact review, and audit logging for autonomous AI agent networks."
